{
  "description": "Live captions, the Loop headless agent step, the issue-schedule overlay, the code-graph upload, the account audit and delete, and the MCP connector start and status. Rows: POST /kb/loop/agent-run (feature auto_tasks), POST /kb/ingest-code-graph (feature code_graph_3d), GET, PUT and DELETE /kb/issue-schedule (feature gantt_issues), GET /kb/live/sessions, GET /kb/live/:id, POST /kb/live/:id/append, POST /kb/live/:id/finalize, GET /kb/live/:id/stream (live captions: core, always on), GET /auth/me/audit, POST /auth/me/delete, POST /auth/mcp-connector/start and GET /auth/mcp-connector/status. Feature-owned rows answer 404 {error: 'feature_disabled', feature: <key>} when that LLMIDE_FEATURES key is off; every such 404 is declared and captured by a second temp-DB server started with auto_tasks, gantt_issues and code_graph_3d off. Fixtures are real responses from `node server.mjs` on a temp DB (127.0.0.1), seeded through the API, with repo paths /example/repo. Exceptions, each stated on its fixture: the loop 200/400-provider/502/503/504 fixtures are produced in-process by calling routes/loop-agent.mjs with its engine seam (deps.runAgent, deps.validateRoot) stubbed, so no model is called and no CLI spawns; the route's response construction is what is captured. Not captured offline, so their 2xx is x-unspecified with a reason: the SSE live stream (no event schema exists in the repo), POST /auth/mcp-connector/start success and 502 (both reach the connector's remote MCP server for dynamic client registration). The 400 for a malformed JSON body (every JSON route) is not declared per route, as SCHEMA.md says. Request fields the fixtures do not exercise are x-optional.",
  "$defs": {
    "LiveCaption": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "seq",
        "speaker",
        "text",
        "ts",
        "source"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "seq": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "speaker": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "ts": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "source": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "meta": {
          "x-optional": true,
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "planTaskId": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "score": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "reason": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LiveSession": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "sessionId",
        "meetingTitle",
        "startedAt",
        "lastWrite",
        "captionCount",
        "sequence"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "sessionId": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "meetingTitle": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "startedAt": {
          "type": "number",
          "description": "Unix ms timestamp when session was created"
        },
        "lastWrite": {
          "type": "number",
          "description": "Unix ms timestamp of last caption append"
        },
        "captionCount": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "sequence": {
          "type": "integer",
          "description": "Highest sequence number written so far"
        }
      }
    },
    "RateLimited": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "error"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "error": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "code",
            "retryAfterSec"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "code": {
              "const": "RATE_LIMITED"
            },
            "retryAfterSec": {
              "type": "integer"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FeatureDisabled": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "error",
        "feature"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "error": {
          "const": "feature_disabled"
        },
        "feature": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "description": "404 body for a path owned by a feature the server was started without (LLMIDE_FEATURES). Deliberately not the Error envelope: a client can tell it from an unknown route without parsing a message.\n"
    },
    "ScheduleItem": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "provider",
        "repo",
        "issueNumber",
        "dependsOn",
        "updatedAt"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "provider": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "repo": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "issueNumber": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "startDate": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "dueDate": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "estimateDays": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "dependsOn": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "integer"
          }
        },
        "updatedAt": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    },
    "LoopUsage": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "inputTokens",
        "outputTokens",
        "cacheReadTokens",
        "cacheCreationTokens",
        "costUsd",
        "numTurns",
        "durationMs"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "inputTokens": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "outputTokens": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "cacheReadTokens": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "cacheCreationTokens": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "costUsd": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "numTurns": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "durationMs": {
          "type": "number"
        }
      }
    },
    "CodeGraphNode": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Required by the server: a node without an id is dropped and counted in droppedNodes."
        },
        "title": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "kind": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "CGNodeKind raw value, e.g. file / function / classType"
        },
        "metadata": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "source_file": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Repo-relative path; absolute or ..-bearing values are discarded"
            },
            "line": {
              "type": [
                "integer",
                "string"
              ],
              "description": "Mac sends it as a string (CodeGraph metadata is [String:String]); the server normalises with String()."
            },
            "language": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "doc": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CodeGraphEdge": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "fromId": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "toId": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "kind": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "CGEdgeKind raw value, e.g. imports / calls / contains"
        },
        "confidence": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    },
    "AuditItem": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "id",
        "action",
        "resource",
        "outcome",
        "detail",
        "createdAt",
        "ip",
        "userAgent"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "action": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "resource": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "outcome": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "detail": {
          "type": [
            "object",
            "null"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": true
        },
        "createdAt": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "ip": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "userAgent": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "endpoints": {
    "POST /kb/loop/agent-run": {
      "request": {
        "body": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "message": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "The composed Loop instruction (max 200000 chars)"
            },
            "skills": {
              "type": [
                "array",
                "string"
              ],
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "description": "a string is refused with 400 (must be an array of ids)"
            },
            "repoRoot": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Absolute path of the run's git root (the worktree in worktree mode)"
            },
            "extraRoots": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "x-optional": true,
              "description": "Absolute paths of project llm-doc/ directories the run may also read and edit (split layout)"
            },
            "language": {
              "type": "string",
              "x-optional": true
            },
            "model": {
              "type": "string",
              "x-optional": true
            },
            "provider": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "\"anthropic\" or an Anthropic-compatible \"custom:<id>\" (one with an anthropicBaseURL). Absent = first-party Anthropic"
            },
            "timeoutMs": {
              "type": "number"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "description": "The Loop step's result. The 200 fixtures are produced in-process (routes/loop-agent.mjs with the engine seam stubbed). The result fields are the engine's runLoopAgent return, forwarded verbatim by the route.",
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "reply",
            "changedPaths",
            "changedExtraPaths",
            "createdPaths",
            "usage",
            "resolvedSkills",
            "unresolvedSkills",
            "truncatedSkills",
            "ran",
            "resultSubtype",
            "denied"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "reply": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "The agent's closing summary"
            },
            "changedPaths": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "description": "Repo-relative paths the agent's Edit/Write calls changed"
            },
            "changedExtraPaths": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "description": "Absolute paths changed inside an accepted extra root"
            },
            "createdPaths": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "description": "The subset of changedPaths a Write created (the file did not exist before the call)"
            },
            "usage": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/LoopUsage"
            },
            "resolvedSkills": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "unresolvedSkills": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "truncatedSkills": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "description": "Resolved skills longer than the cap; only their head was sent"
            },
            "ran": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "resultSubtype": {
              "type": [
                "string",
                "null"
              ],
              "description": "The SDK result subtype (success, error_max_turns, …), or no_progress when LLM-IDE stopped the step because it was repeating itself (the same call again with no file changed) or 5 tool calls in a row failed"
            },
            "denied": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "toolName",
                  "reason"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "toolName": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "reason": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "noProgressReason": {
              "type": "string",
              "x-optional": true,
              "description": "Present only with resultSubtype no_progress — why the step was stopped"
            }
          }
        },
        "400": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        },
        "401": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        },
        "404": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/FeatureDisabled"
        },
        "502": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        },
        "503": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        },
        "504": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        }
      }
    },
    "POST /kb/ingest-code-graph": {
      "request": {
        "body": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "repoPath": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Absolute path to the repo root (must be on user allow-list)"
            },
            "graph": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "nodes": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "$ref": "#/$defs/CodeGraphNode"
                  }
                },
                "edges": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "$ref": "#/$defs/CodeGraphEdge"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "replace": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "description": "Clear this producer's existing rows for the repo first (first batch only)"
            },
            "commitSha": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Git commit the graph was generated from (7-64 hex); find-code compares it to HEAD to warn about a stale graph"
            },
            "generatedAt": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "ISO-8601 time the graph was generated"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "ok",
            "repo",
            "nodes",
            "edges",
            "droppedNodes",
            "droppedEdges",
            "replaced"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "ok": {
              "const": true
            },
            "repo": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "canonical repo path"
            },
            "nodes": {
              "type": "integer",
              "description": "nodes written"
            },
            "edges": {
              "type": "integer",
              "description": "edges written"
            },
            "droppedNodes": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "droppedEdges": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "replaced": {
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          }
        },
        "400": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        },
        "401": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        },
        "403": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        },
        "404": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/FeatureDisabled"
        }
      }
    },
    "GET /kb/issue-schedule": {
      "request": {
        "query": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "provider": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "repo": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "schedules",
            "count"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "schedules": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/ScheduleItem"
              }
            },
            "count": {
              "type": "integer"
            }
          }
        },
        "400": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        },
        "401": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        },
        "404": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/FeatureDisabled"
        }
      }
    },
    "PUT /kb/issue-schedule": {
      "request": {
        "body": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "provider": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "repo": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "\"owner/name\""
            },
            "issueNumber": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "startDate": {
              "type": [
                "string",
                "null"
              ],
              "description": "YYYY-MM-DD or null to clear"
            },
            "dueDate": {
              "type": [
                "string",
                "null"
              ],
              "description": "YYYY-MM-DD or null to clear"
            },
            "estimateDays": {
              "type": [
                "number",
                "null"
              ]
            },
            "dependsOn": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "description": "issue numbers"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ScheduleItem"
        },
        "400": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        },
        "401": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        },
        "404": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/FeatureDisabled"
        }
      }
    },
    "DELETE /kb/issue-schedule": {
      "request": {
        "body": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "provider": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "repo": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "issueNumber": {
              "type": [
                "integer",
                "string"
              ],
              "description": "a non-integer is refused with 400 VALIDATION_FAILED"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "deleted"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "deleted": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "description": "false when no schedule existed"
            }
          }
        },
        "400": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        },
        "401": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        },
        "404": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/FeatureDisabled"
        }
      }
    },
    "GET /kb/live/sessions": {
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "sessions"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "sessions": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/LiveSession"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "401": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        }
      }
    },
    "GET /kb/live/:id": {
      "request": {
        "params": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "id"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "id": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        },
        "query": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "since": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "decimal caption sequence; captions after it are returned"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "captions",
            "sequence",
            "finalized",
            "exists"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "captions": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/LiveCaption"
              }
            },
            "sequence": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "finalized": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "exists": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "description": "false when the sessionId is unknown (never had captions appended)"
            },
            "meetingTitle": {
              "type": "string",
              "x-optional": true
            },
            "startedAt": {
              "type": "number",
              "x-optional": true,
              "description": "Unix ms timestamp when session was created"
            }
          }
        },
        "401": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        }
      }
    },
    "POST /kb/live/:id/append": {
      "request": {
        "params": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "id"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "id": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        },
        "body": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "captions": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "speaker": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "text": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "ts": {
                    "type": "number"
                  },
                  "source": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "meta": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "x-optional": true,
                    "properties": {
                      "planTaskId": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "score": {
                        "type": "number"
                      },
                      "reason": {
                        "type": "string"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "description": "Array of caption objects (text, speaker, timestamp, etc.)"
            },
            "meetingTitle": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "sequence",
            "accepted"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "sequence": {
              "type": "integer",
              "description": "Highest sequence number in the session after this append"
            },
            "accepted": {
              "type": "integer",
              "description": "Number of caption items accepted (0 when session is already finalized)"
            },
            "backpressure": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "x-optional": true,
              "description": "Advisory — true when the ring buffer is ≥90% full; callers should throttle"
            },
            "finalized": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "x-optional": true,
              "description": "Present (true) when the session was already finalized; all captions were dropped"
            }
          }
        },
        "400": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        },
        "401": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        },
        "429": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/RateLimited"
        }
      }
    },
    "POST /kb/live/:id/finalize": {
      "request": {
        "params": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "id"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "id": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "sessionId",
                "finalized",
                "captionCount",
                "dbCleaned",
                "cleanupError"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "sessionId": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "finalized": {
                  "const": true
                },
                "captionCount": {
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                "dbCleaned": {
                  "type": "boolean",
                  "description": "the meetings row written by crash-recovery was removed"
                },
                "cleanupError": {
                  "type": [
                    "string",
                    "null"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "sessionId",
                "finalized",
                "captionCount"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "sessionId": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "finalized": {
                  "const": true
                },
                "captionCount": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "description": "0: the id was never seen, so the route answers the empty summary"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "401": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        }
      }
    },
    "GET /kb/live/:id/stream": {
      "request": {
        "params": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "id"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "id": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "x-unspecified": "Server-sent events: a leading newline, then data: lines carrying the GET /kb/live/:id body (captions, sequence, finalized, exists) whenever new captions arrive, a ': heartbeat' comment every 30 s, and an end after 10 minutes idle. There is no event schema in the repo, so the stream is described here and not typed."
        },
        "401": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        },
        "429": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        }
      }
    },
    "GET /auth/me/audit": {
      "request": {
        "query": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "limit": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "capped at 1000; default 100 Capped at 500; the default is 100 when absent or zero."
            },
            "action": {
              "type": "string",
              "x-optional": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "items"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "items": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/AuditItem"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "401": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        }
      }
    },
    "POST /auth/me/delete": {
      "request": {
        "body": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "password": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "ok",
            "counts"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "ok": {
              "const": true
            },
            "counts": {
              "type": "object",
              "description": "rows removed per table",
              "additionalProperties": {
                "type": "integer"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "401": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        }
      }
    },
    "POST /auth/mcp-connector/start": {
      "request": {
        "body": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "id": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "connector id, e.g. miro"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "x-unspecified": "Success returns { authUrl, state } for the Mac app to open, or { state, alreadyConnected: true } when the vault already holds a token. Not captured offline: the start contacts the connector's remote MCP server for dynamic client registration, which needs the network."
        },
        "400": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        },
        "401": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        },
        "502": {
          "x-unspecified": "MCP_AUTH_START_FAILED when the remote MCP server cannot be reached or refuses registration. Needs the network, so not captured offline."
        }
      }
    },
    "GET /auth/mcp-connector/status": {
      "request": {
        "query": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "id": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "state": {
              "type": "string",
              "x-optional": true,
              "description": "a sign-in flow started by POST /auth/mcp-connector/start; only its initiator may read it"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "id",
            "connected",
            "status"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "id": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "connected": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "description": "reads the vault: true when this user holds tokens for the connector"
            },
            "status": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "pending, complete, error, or unknown (no flow, or already read)"
            },
            "account": {
              "type": "string",
              "x-optional": true
            },
            "message": {
              "type": "string",
              "x-optional": true
            }
          }
        },
        "400": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        },
        "401": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
